    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice puzzle adventure game where you take on the role of an amnesiac girl trapped in the ether world, constantly learning Mandarin words to solve puzzles while using them to activate magic and defeat enemies. Can you complete the challenge of using Mandarin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ether world in the game is a multi space constructed by consciousness, and players need to shuttle through various spaces to search for lost memories. In addition to using voice to defeat powerful enemies, players can also meet friends and learn social idioms through voice, and learn how to use vocabulary in interactive games. In the later stages of the game, you can even command NPC characters to collaborate in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning efficiency without a language environment is low, practicing listening and speaking in games will accelerate vocabulary memory</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice of core Mandarin vocabulary from easy to difficult</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic vocabulary combination application exercise</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice common short sentences through voice interaction with NPCs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846300/extras/ca88e0a607e04d2aaeaef1c256d7476d.poster.avif?t=1752848626\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846300/extras/ca88e0a607e04d2aaeaef1c256d7476d.webm?t=1752848626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846300/extras/ca88e0a607e04d2aaeaef1c256d7476d.mp4?t=1752848626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice puzzle adventure game where you take on the role of an amnesiac girl trapped in the ether world, constantly learning Mandarin words to solve puzzles while using them to activate magic and defeat enemies. Can you complete the challenge of using Mandarin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ether world in the game is a multi space constructed by consciousness, and players need to shuttle through various spaces to search for lost memories. In addition to using voice to defeat powerful enemies, players can also meet friends and learn social idioms through voice, and learn how to use vocabulary in interactive games. In the later stages of the game, you can even command NPC characters to collaborate in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning efficiency without a language environment is low, practicing listening and speaking in games will accelerate vocabulary memory</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice of core Mandarin vocabulary from easy to difficult</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic vocabulary combination application exercise</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice common short sentences through voice interaction with NPCs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846300/extras/ca88e0a607e04d2aaeaef1c256d7476d.poster.avif?t=1752848626\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846300/extras/ca88e0a607e04d2aaeaef1c256d7476d.webm?t=1752848626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846300/extras/ca88e0a607e04d2aaeaef1c256d7476d.mp4?t=1752848626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
